[E0412] Error: `bump` writes through its receiver
    ╭─[ err/98_dyn_interfaces/main.wip:37:32 ]
    │
 37 │ fn writes(c: &dyn Counter) = c.bump(1)  // a `var fn` through `&dyn`
    │                                ──┬─  
    │                                  ╰─── a `var fn`
    │ 
    │ Note: a `&dyn` reference only reads; `&var dyn` writes
────╯
[E0337] Error: no method `total` on `dyn Counter`
