    │ 
 42 │ fn grower(g: &dyn Grower): i64 = 0
    │                   ───┬──  
    │                      ╰──── `grown` is written with `Self`
    │ 
    │ Help: `Grower` still works as a constraint: `fn f<T: Grower>(x: &T)`
    │ 
    │ Note: a call through a table does not know what `Self` is
