[E0344] Error: a `dyn` type must be borrowed
    ╭─[ err/98_dyn_interfaces/main.wip:44:12 ]
    │
 44 │ fn bare(c: dyn Counter): i64 = 0        // not behind `&`
    │            ─────┬─────  
    │                 ╰─────── a value of unknown type has no size of its own
    │ 
    │ Help: borrow it
    │ 
    │ Note: a `dyn` value lives somewhere else, and is known by a pointer and a table of methods, so it exists only behind `&` or `&var`
────╯
